; Original init->vold/apexd transitions already exist in pinned AOSP policy.
; Actual170 enforcing audit1090939/1090942 denies only the extra Linux NNP
; admission gate before exec. Preserve NNP1, original transition/entrypoint
; checks, IDs and caps. Never allow init execute_no_trans on daemon executables.
(allow init vold (process2 (nnp_transition)))
(allow init apexd (process2 (nnp_transition)))
